LESSONS.protheion72={title:'Protheion：近战吸取与随后处决',kind:'N5.3 · p109 Example 1',reviewDate:'2026-10-23',source:'https://infinitythewiki.com/Protheion',question:'吸取先治疗还是先加VITA？',answer:'可选自动技能，主动及ARO近战均可。先治疗已有伤口，再提高VITA（最多初始+2），最后承受同令伤害；处决吸取1，Dead以后的多余失败不计。',positions:[[20,25],[20,25-25/25.4]],terrain:[],overrides:[{name:'吸取者（教学）',cc:20,protheion:true,protheionMod:-3},{name:'近战目标',cc:15,arm:0}],equipment:{a0:{loadout:['cc'],weapon:'cc'},b0:{loadout:['cc'],weapon:'cc'}},instructions:'待机 → 蓝方近战ARO → 红方近战并启用Protheion → 12对6，目标过保20昏迷，红方VITA2。下一令对昏迷目标近战处决，无骰，红方VITA3并显示Power-Up2。',dice:[12,6,20]};
